          "short": "$39\\,991$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}203\\times197&=(200+3)(200-3)\\\\203\\times197&=200^2-3^2\\\\203\\times197&=40\\,000-9\\\\203\\times197&=39\\,991\\end{align*}$$",
